{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870460/extras/ef9dafef94f72a3e27710f09422be7c9.poster.avif?t=1755707244\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870460/extras/ef9dafef94f72a3e27710f09422be7c9.webm?t=1755707244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes of Mora brings the fantasy of diving into a mysterious underwater world to life. Swim through a flooded, abandoned village, find hidden objects, and uncover secrets in this atmospheric narrative adventure. Whether you choose VR or non-VR mode\u2014join young Mora in her quest to find her missing brother across the boundaries of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870460/extras/14d3fd51ec2515ec6a5de70075270ac7.webp?t=1755707244\" width=616 height=39 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870460/extras/7e67f66c504051ceb037809e9c6f79de.poster.avif?t=1755707244\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870460/extras/7e67f66c504051ceb037809e9c6f79de.webm?t=1755707244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues about the village's story, solve puzzles, and unlock Echoes to see the events before the flood. Inside these time portals, experience the village's beauty before the tragedy, hear villagers' conversations, and communicate with Mora.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After her brother disappears near a cursed violet lake, Mora sets out to find him. As the lake's water rises, threatening the village, your help is crucial. Share clues you find in the underwater world, guide Mora in the past, and accompany her on a\u00a0time-bending journey that could decide the flood's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870460/extras/f4b5f760239e228ccd0b57c62e4eced0.webp?t=1755707244\" width=616 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870460/extras/a9c1dfb2ec16342fc24d2f0e5f87727c.poster.avif?t=1755707244\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870460/extras/a9c1dfb2ec16342fc24d2f0e5f87727c.webm?t=1755707244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Play in VR mode to fully immerse yourself in the rich world of Echoes of Mora. Using motion-tracking, you can move your arms to smoothly navigate the sunken landscape and enjoy lots of intriguing interactions with the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also offers a full PC-only mode, giving you complete freedom to choose how you explore the underwater world.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870460/extras/d8672cc4930260e1aff9990c6f47657c.webp?t=1755707244\" width=616 height=39 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a captivating underwater world with an emotional story about a sibling duo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles, unlock Echoes to travel back in time &amp; collect hidden clues to unravel the story behind Mora's missing brother</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience immersive swimming controls with motion tracking in VR mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact directly with Mora in the past to shape the fate of the village</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in VR &amp; non-VR mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with all PC-based VR headsets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870460/extras/98959e45c95e84d4f227009dfd1cdfb8.webp?t=1755707244\" width=616 height=39 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On game launch:</strong> choose to play in PC-VR or standard PC mode (ability to switch between them mid-session will be added in a future update)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the tutorial:</strong> learn to swim &amp; interact with objects before you dive deeper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore one third of the world:</strong> including the forest, the lake area &amp; Mora's house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the beginning of the story:</strong> uncover the first five Echoes (out of 20) &amp; share your first encounter with Mora herself</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870460?t=1755707244","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870460/438c1caff4c8499707a55c5d98cd3e60605723e3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755707244","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870460/cfeffba4efbe16d695414e984157db538f4adc6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755707244","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870460/cfeffba4efbe16d695414e984157db538f4adc6c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755707244","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description